<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus's October CPI up 0.88 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Cyprus's October CPI up 0.88 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's CPI increased 0.88 percent in October from September due to seasonal increases in fresh fruit and vegetables, clothing and footwear items.</p>
<p>The index rose to 117.84 units compared to 116.81 in September, the department of statistics and research said.</p>
<p>    Consumer Price Index	Oct 96   Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>    Month/month change(pct)    0.88	1.72	 1.75</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)     2.99	3.88	 0.43</p>
<p>    Index (1992=100)	   117.84    116.81     114.41</p>
<p>Michele Kambas, Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089.</p>
</text>
